# Cite-ready software citation for Coticula.
# GitHub "Cite this repository" reads this file. No DOI is registered yet.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Coticula, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "Coticula: a touchstone harness for PDE understanding"
abstract: >-
  Coticula is a small harness for PDE surrogates. Four exams (Predict,
  Conserve, Counterfactual, Explain) score viscous Burgers (1D) and heat (2D).
  v0.2 added a 48-item Exam 4 set with rule-based (non-LLM) grades and
  residual-vs-L2 diagnostics. v0.3.0 adds a command-line scorecard and a
  small adapter interface for a user model. v0.3.1 polishes that scorecard.
  Reports contain only measured numbers; missing checkpoints stay not_trained.
authors:
  - family-names: Pathan
    given-names: Shehbaz
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-10-10"
url: "https://github.com/shehbaz0101/coticula"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shehbaz0101/coticula"
keywords:
  - Coticula
  - PDE
  - surrogate
  - Fourier neural operator
  - PINO
  - understanding harness
